AI features 
Telegram bots offer a number of features for AI chatbots

Edit bot information
sers can edit and localize the profile picture, name, about text and description of bots they own; the same can be done by
the bots themselves.

Commands
Bots offer a set of commands that can be used by users in private, or in a chat.

Buttons
Users can interact with your bor via buttons or even inline buttons, straight from inline messages in any chat.

Menu button
BOts can choose the behaviour of the menu button shown to the text input field.

Suggested bot admin reights
Bots can suggest a set of admin rights when being added to groups and channels.

Inline queries
Users can interact with your bot via inline queries, straight from the text input field in any chat.

Guest mode
Guest bots can be queried by username from any non-secret chat, posting their results into the chat on behalf of the user
that invoked them.

Bot-to-bot communication
Bots may receive and send messages to and from other bots in groups, private chats and chats,
if Bot-to-Bot Communication Mode is enabled.

Games
